1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
dash-2: top-down action for one player.
Find the line. Break the limit.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Crosscut: dash through directional gates.
Adjust your path and manage your charges.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Return projectiles with F and find an opening.
The final core has three phases.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
An automated replay using ordinary inputs.
Gameplay runs at its normal speed.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Six trials, two difficulties and practice mode.
A playable Windows build is available.

